# Site chrome — announce + nav + nav-cta + footer (add, never weaken)

Static site, **no build pipeline**. These blocks are **copied identically** on every page (root + `casos/`). Nested pages only differ by a `../` prefix on relative `href`/`src`.

## Source of truth
- `partials/site-chrome/announce.html` — brown top bar; **sole** home of Agendar CTA
- `partials/site-chrome/nav-links.html` — links **inside** `#site-nav`
- `partials/site-chrome/nav-cta.html` — Login + lang-switch only (**no** Agendar)
- `partials/site-chrome/footer.html` — full `<footer>…</footer>`
- Wrapper: `python3 scripts/sync-site-chrome.py` (write) · `--check` (CI / check-all)

## Agent workflow
1. **Edit the partial**, not a single page’s chrome.
2. Run `python3 scripts/sync-site-chrome.py`.
3. Confirm `python3 scripts/sync-site-chrome.py --check` is green.
4. Do **not** invent a one-off Contabilidade / Caso link in the footer — sector pages live under **Verticais** (`verticais.html` in footer Recursos only; **not** in top `#site-nav` — keeps logo breathing room).
5. Never put Agendar / `mini-btn` inside `<header>` — only in `.announce`.

## Guardrails
- `tests/test_site_surface.py` — Faro on every human page; announce / nav / nav-cta / footer identical; Agendar not in header; `.legal` CTA contrast
- `tests/test_guardrails.py` — footer/nav (also) + sync `--check`
- `scripts/check-all.sh` runs chrome `--check` **and** `tests.test_site_surface` before the full suite
- Skill: `.claude/skills/site-chrome/SKILL.md` (and `.agents` mirror if present)
